{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystal Haven is a laid-back, open-world creature-collecting game with 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you play with others or go solo, you'll collect cute creatures and explore new worlds. Plus, your single-player saves work in multiplayer, so there's no need to start all over if you want to play with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Supports both local 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends. Please note that random match making isn't available at the moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Collecting</strong>: As you explore, add new creatures to your vault and raise them into more powerful adult versions that grow slightly larger with each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Battles</strong>: Battle using traditional turn-based attacks or real-time overworld attacks. Play the way you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Actions</strong>: Ride, feed, and even breed your creatures to produce rare hybrid types.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shard Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980250/0c69df7b0d7e85006cc0d060aa7826d8ecf300e9.jpg"},{"name":"Food Bond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980250/f110596fdef26c42dd9bd0433e39d17e34853348.jpg"},{"name":"Dance Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980250/250851fa58c57653e9fe928e46bd939ffef70ddc.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1980250/deceb4687f2834082e300cd8513bea0e85540139.jpg"},{"name":"World Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/